==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[decrepid]] {{qualifier|obsolete}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|en}} {{term|décrépit|lang=frm}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|decrepitus||very old|lang=la}}, from {{term|crepare||to creak|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/dɪˈkɹɛp.ɪt/}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Weakened or worn out from age or wear

====Derived terms====
* [[decrepitly]]
* [[decrepitude]]

